1 CREATE

   CREATE/RIGHTS makes the rights database on VMS.  govax's authorization
   file always has one, so the command is accepted and does nothing.

   Format

     CREATE/RIGHTS

2 Qualifiers
/RIGHTS

   The rights database, the only thing CREATE makes.

1 DEFAULT

   Changes the DEFAULT record, which ADD copies for each new account.

   Format

     DEFAULT /qualifier...

2 Qualifiers
/ACCOUNT

      /ACCOUNT=name

   The account name, up to 8 characters, for the accounting records.
