/MAXACCTJOBS

      /MAXACCTJOBS=n

   The most jobs the account's name may have at once.  Kept and shown.

/MAXDETACH

      /MAXDETACH=n

   The most detached processes the user may have.  Kept and shown.

/MAXJOBS

      /MAXJOBS=n

   The most jobs the user may have at once.  Kept and shown.

/OWNER

      /OWNER="name"

   The person the account belongs to, up to 31 characters.

/PASSWORD

      /[NO]PASSWORD=text

   The account's password, which govax keeps only as an Argon2id hash.
